cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GHOSTRACE"
message: "If GHOSTRACE supports your work, please cite the repository and the version used."
type: software
license: MPL-2.0
abstract: >-
  GHOSTRACE is a local macOS causal event journal that records bounded,
  user-authorized evidence about changes and explains the observations supporting
  each causal link.
keywords:
  - causal event journal
  - macOS
  - provenance
  - privacy
  - FSEvents
